# Public OAuth client ID from https://developer.audiotool.com/applications.
# Register the local redirect origin http://127.0.0.1:5173 and the production
# origin https://qvesterstudio.com. Never put an Audiotool client secret here.
VITE_AUDIOTOOL_NEXUS_CLIENT_ID=

# Where the NEXUS SDK fetches its validator at runtime. The SDK reads the WASM
# from disk automatically under Node, but in a browser it fetches it, so this
# must point at a real path or every createOfflineDocument() call 404s.
# Vendor both files into public/audiotool-nexus/ (see
# scripts/vendor-audiotool-wasm.mjs).
VITE_WASM_ASSETS_PREFIX=/audiotool-nexus/
